# Basic Security Tools and Utilities
# This list contains essential security tools that are useful across all spins,
# providing fundamental security capabilities without specialized forensics focus

## System Integrity and Monitoring
# Core system security checks and monitoring tools
checksecurity         # Basic system security checks
aide                  # Advanced Intrusion Detection Environment
sysdig                # System-level exploration and monitoring

## Access Control and Auditing
# Authentication, authorization, and system auditing
acl                   # Access control list utilities
auditd                # System audit daemon

## Filesystem Monitoring
# Tools for tracking and monitoring filesystem activity
inotify-tools         # Filesystem monitoring and event notification
fatrace               # File access trace tool

## Malware Protection
# Basic antivirus capabilities
clamav                # Antivirus scanner
clamav-daemon         # Antivirus scanner daemon

## Scheduled Tasks
# Support for automated and periodic task execution
cron                 # System scheduler for regular task execution
anacron              # Periodic command scheduler for systems not running continuously

# Crypto policy support
crypto-policies
crypto-policies-scripts
